# The build context is the Rust workspace and the client source. Documentation,
# research data, repository tooling, and local build output never enter it.
.git
.github
.gitignore
target
**/target
docs/*
!docs/registry
data
tools
config
apps/web/node_modules
apps/web/dist
apps/web/test-results
apps/web/playwright-report
apps/web/blob-report
*.md
